<title>USA: Technology Flavors sees Q1 profit.</title>
<headline>Technology Flavors sees Q1 profit.</headline>
<dateline>AMITYVILLE, N.Y. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Technology Flavors &amp; Fragrances Inc on Thursday said it expected to post a profit and record sales in the first quarter after reporting a loss for 1996.</p>
<p>The company said its performance reflected a cost-improvement program and research and development investments last year.</p>
<p>Earlier Thursday, the company said it lost $2.5 million, or $0.21 a share, in 1996, on sales of $21.0 million.</p>
</text>
